warning[L0504]: `clamp` changes an argument, so its name should end with `!`
 --> check/missing_bang_on_set_parameter.knv:1:7
  |
1 | (defn clamp (x)
  |       ^^^^^ this function changes an argument
2 |   (if (> x 10) (set! x 10) (do))
  |                ----------- this changes the caller's value
  |
  = help: rename it `clamp!`
  = help: to change only this function's copy, start the body with `(local x x)`

warning[L0504]: `rename` changes an argument, so its name should end with `!`
 --> check/missing_bang_on_set_parameter.knv:5:7
  |
5 | (defn rename (name)
  |       ^^^^^^ this function changes an argument
6 |   (set! name (str "ana"))
  |   ----------------------- this changes the caller's value
  |
  = help: rename it `rename!`
  = help: to change only this function's copy, start the body with `(local name (clone name))`

(type clamp (fn ((mut i64)) unit))
(type rename (fn ((mut string)) unit))
(type main (fn () unit))
